  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 102.061 Technical Advice Memorandum",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-07-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 102.061 Technical Advice Memorandum. The commissioner shall exercise final approval over all technical advice memoranda issued to any department division or bureau. For the purposes of this rule “technical advice memorandum” means a directive intended to implement laws, rules, and policies as specified by RSA 541-A:16, II(a).\n\nSource. #6715, INTERIM, eff 4-1-98, EXPIRED: 7-30-98\n\nNew. #6835, eff 8-26-98",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c100.html"
